• Compile data for and prepare case studies &nbsp;

• Maintain healthy peer-to-peer client relations &nbsp;

• Prepare all client documents &nbsp;

• Identify&nbsp;and track client issues &nbsp;

• Provide weekly status and&nbsp;participate&nbsp;in status meetings &nbsp;

• Assist&nbsp;with special projects as assigned &nbsp;

Skills and Experience&nbsp;

Your Qualifications: &nbsp;

• A&nbsp;Bachelor’s Degree in advertising, marketing, business&nbsp;administration&nbsp;or communication; OR equivalent professional work experience &nbsp;

